<title>PHILIPPINES: Forum jumps 12.28 pct by midsession.</title>
<headline>Forum jumps 12.28 pct by midsession.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-converted holding company Forum Pacific Inc soared 14 centavos, or 12.28 percent, to 1.28 pesos in active mid-session trade following its move to diversify into financial and petrochemical ventures, brokers said.</p>
